  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Cen. Nac. Pobla. y Viv. y Enc. sobre Presupuesto de Hogares: Aum. Estadi. Bas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nat. Pop.  Housing Census  Household Budget Survey: Incre. use of Basic Stats.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa consiste en incrementar y facilitar eluso de la informacin demogrfica, social, econmica y cultural bsica de laRepublica de Suriname. Sus objetivos especficos consisten en (i) actualizar losdatos estadsticos y hacerlos ms precisos; (ii) dar acceso ms expedito a los datos difundidos, y (iii) producir y difundir datos en forma oportuna mediante elfortalecimiento de la capacidad institucional de la OGE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to increase and facilitate the use of the basic demographic, social, economic, and cultural information of the Republic of Suriname. The specific objectives of the program are: (i) to update the statistical data and improve its accuracy; (ii) to achieve greater accessibility to disseminated data; and (iii) to produce and disseminate data in a timely manner through the strengthening of the institutional capacity of the GBS.</narrative>
  </description>
